OL,3,GNEWSA'Record-breaking' Mod returns to
OL,4,AGlasgow for Gaelic celebration
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Royal National Mod is starting in
OL,7,FGlasgow later, with organisers
OL,8,Fpredicting the competition's 194th
OL,9,Fanniversary will prove to be a
OL,10,Frecord-breaking year.
OL,12,FThe annual celebration of Scots Gaelic
OL,13,Fculture, language and history, brings
OL,14,Ftogether thousands of acts and
OL,15,Fspectators from across the country.
OL,17,FMore than 2,000 entries have been
OL,18,Fregistered by people aiming to take
OL,19,Fpart in some of the festival's 200
OL,20,Fcompetitions, the highest total on
OL,21,Frecord.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
