OL,3,GNEWSA'Record-breaking' Mod returns to
OL,4,AGlasgow for Gaelic celebration
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlongside the official contests in
OL,7,Fareas such as bagpiping, Highland
OL,8,Fdancing and Gaelic literature, more
OL,9,Fthan 80 fringe events are also running,
OL,10,Foffering educational sessions, ceilidhs
OL,11,Fand musical performances.
